0..53 Comment "//! This source shows temporary access through views."
54..57 Comment "//!"
58..109 Comment "//! A hold keeps a value for the rest of its block."
110..167 Comment "//! Each exclusive view ends once by `resume` or `abort`."
168..171 Comment "//!"
172..217 Comment "//! `resume` writes a value back to the hold."
218..262 Comment "//! `abort` runs an empty-row unwind clause."
263..326 Comment "//! The loan follows a mutable borrow of Rust [Rust-reference],"
327..351 Comment "//! § Borrow operators."
